mupen64plus-libretro-nx @ 98c1b0d877542b01314b3b04272282ba223b65b3 (cores-experimental's mupen64plus_next pin): core option
mupen64plus-BufferSwapMode (OnVIUpdate default = the old hard-coded bsOnVerticalInterrupt | OnVIOriginChange | OnBufferUpdate),
replacing the fixed value in custom/GLideN64/mupenplus/Config_mupenplus.cpp. ai-22 (N64 Debug), 2026-10-17, for the Zero 28's
58.3 VI/s under per-VI presents (user: "Do it now"). Per-game GLideN64.custom.ini overrides still apply after it.

